--------------------------------------------------------------------------
What the evidence in this repository does and does not support
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

Results here are measured on synthetic clinic dialogue under frozen,
preregistered protocols. They are not evidence of clinical validity, of
open-world generalization, or of fitness for patient care. Negative results
are retained deliberately; six consecutive improvement hypotheses (H1-H6) were
rejected under their own gates and those records are part of the evidence, not
an omission. See papers/EVIDENCE_MANIFEST.json for per-claim status and
known absences.
